<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="view_sync_import_wizard_form" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">centrivo.sync.import.wizard.form</field>
        <field name="model">centrivo.sync.import.wizard</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <form string="Importa prodotti">
                <group>
                    <field name="channel_id" readonly="1"/>
                    <field name="upload_filename" invisible="1"/>
                    <field name="headers_loaded" invisible="1"/>
                    <field name="upload_file" filename="upload_filename"
                           widget="binary"/>
                </group>
                <div class="mb-2">
                    <button name="action_read_headers" type="object"
                            string="1. Leggi intestazioni" class="btn-secondary"/>
                </div>
                <field name="line_ids">
                    <list editable="bottom" create="false">
                        <field name="sequence" widget="handle"/>
                        <field name="source_header"/>
                        <field name="is_missing" optional="show"/>
                        <field name="destination_kind"/>
                        <field name="special_target"
                               invisible="destination_kind != 'special'"
                               required="destination_kind == 'special'"/>
                        <field name="dest_field_id"
                               invisible="destination_kind != 'field'"
                               required="destination_kind == 'field'"/>
                        <field name="active_in_run"/>
                    </list>
                </field>
                <p class="text-muted">
                    Attiva solo le colonne che vuoi applicare in QUESTO giro. Per
                    CREARE prodotti nuovi servono attive "Nome prodotto",
                    "Riferimento interno" e "Codice fornitore (CHIAVE)"; per il solo
                    AGGIORNAMENTO di prodotti esistenti basta il "Codice fornitore
                    (CHIAVE)". Il Riferimento interno (default_code) si compila a mano
                    nell'Excel e si mappa come una colonna qualsiasi.
                </p>
                <footer>
                    <button name="action_import" type="object"
                            string="Importa" class="btn-primary"/>
                    <button name="action_save_mapping" type="object"
                            string="Salva mappatura sul fornitore"
                            class="btn-secondary"/>
                    <button string="Annulla" class="btn-secondary" special="cancel"/>
                </footer>
            </form>
        </field>
    </record>
</odoo>
